      "tier": "exact"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "nodeId": "n5",
      "text": "\\* 65% of Americans know that eight 8-ounce glasses of water is the recommended daily serving.",
      "contextBefore": "exercise, roughly an extra 4 ounces for every 15 minutes of activity. A survey of 3,003 Americans shows that: \\* Americans consume 12.8 8-ounce servings of beverages each day, but only 4.6 are water. ",
